scikit-learn kutubxonasi bilan amalga oshirish juda oson: from sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression, model = LinearRegression(), model.fit(X, y). Lekin asosini tushunish muhim — boshqa algoritmlar shu printsipga asoslangan.', '2026-03-17 03:27:00');

